                                                "sense_id": "3c819ec2-11b6-35cd-abd3-6899f15e93c6",
                                                "text": "The decimal character of 4.1 is a reminder that this is not a conventional H isotope such as quadrium, ⁴H, or other isotopes up to ⁷H, with lifetimes, when known in the 0.1 to 1 zs range."
