                                                "sense_id": "26d69716-12f8-375a-853c-9e8be720fa2b",
                                                "text": "The almost stationary ultra-cold neutron(s) occupies a position in the metal lattice where another dissolved hydrogen is most likely to tunnel in less than a nanosecond, forming a deuteron / triton / quadrium by capturing the cold neutron and releasing binding energy."
